title: Host and guest type in the same file and end with the same text
folders: rust-small
limit: 80
guest-expect-log: opening .*shared
expect-log: is shared, \d+ files

wait 3000
goto src/main.rs
share start writers
wait 9000
edit src/main.rs 4 1
key end
type  // from the host
wait 4000
mark host-both
wait 600
share stop
wait 1200
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1500
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4000
goto src/main.rs
wait 1200
tool edit
edit src/main.rs 6 1
type // from Beto
wait 5500
mark both
wait 9000
quit
wait 1500
